{
  "id": "math5-c1-s3-n25",
  "card_id": "math5-c1-s3-n25",
  "chapter": "第一章　正数和负数",
  "section": "§ 3. 加法和减法",
  "number": "25",
  "title": "解方程",
  "printed_title": "25. 解方程",
  "start_page": 110,
  "start_printed": 101,
  "figures": [
    {
      "id": "fig-102",
      "label": "图 102",
      "page": 110
    }
  ],
  "exercise_count": 16,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在这以前，我们解方程时用了不同的法则.有时运用求未知加数的法则，有时应用求未知被减数的法则，还有时应用求未知减数的法则.现在，已经学习了正负数的加法和减法，我们就可以用把方程的两边加上同一个数的方法解所有这些方程.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 101,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0110#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例1.解方程$x+6=15$（图102）.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 101,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0110#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-102",
      "label": "图 102",
      "printed_page": 101,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0110#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图102",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 102",
      "printed_page": 101,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0110#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "先从方程的左边减去6（从左边的秤盘拿掉一公斤和五公斤的两个砝码）.为了保持方程的两边相等，必须从方程的右边也减去6（为了保持平衡，从右边秤盘也拿掉一公斤和五公斤的两个砝码）：$x+6-6=15-6$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 101,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0110#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "可以说，我们在方程的左边和右边都加上了一个6的相反数$-6$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 101,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0110#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "化简新方程的左边和右边，得：$x=9$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 102,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0111#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "9是方程$x+6=15$的根，因为等式$9+6=15$成立.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 102,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0111#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例2.解方程$x-8=13$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 102,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0111#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在方程的左、右两边各加$-8$的相反数8：$x-8+8=13+8$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 102,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0111#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "左边得$x$，右边得21.于是$x=21$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 102,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0111#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例3.解方程$48-(25+x)=33$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 102,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0111#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "把方程左边的括号去掉：$48-25-x=33$，$23-x=33$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 102,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0111#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "左边和右边各加$-23$：$23-x-23=33-23$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 102,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0111#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "得：$-x=10$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 102,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0111#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "假如$x$的相反数等于10，那么$x$等于$-10$：$x=-10$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 102,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0111#10"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
